ss-module__nbagBW__learnContent"><header><h1>Find All Permutations</h1></he=
ader><div class=3D"style-module-scss-module__ubvNPq__problemDescription"><p=
>Return <strong>all possible permutations</strong> of a given array of uniq=
ue integers. They can be returned in any order.</p><h4 id=3D"example">Examp=
le:</h4><pre><code class=3D"hljs language-python">Input: nums =3D [<span cl=
