', is reached in the bottom-right branch, resulting in the message 'one per=
mutation found!' in green, indicating a successful permutation generation. =
 The diagram visually demonstrates the backtracking nature of the algorithm=
, as each branch explores a different permutation possibility." loading=3D"=
