<hr>
<p>Are there any other numbers we can append to [4, 5]? Well, 6 is the only=
 option at this point, which we already explored. So, let's backtrack again=
 by removing 5, bringing us back to [4]:</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display:flex;justify-content:center"><=
